     mods). Original <Components> lists reproduced in full (verified against each mod's own
     source .sbc) with the new Military Components (PrototechFrame) placed immediately BEFORE the
     Computer component, and CriticalComponent set to that Computer (Index 0), so the Military
     Components are required for the block to be functional (below the functional line) and the
     line sits at the Computer. (Changed 2026-09-20. Previously appended at the END, after the
     source mod's own CriticalComponent, which was usually the first SteelPlate. An intermediate
     version put it right AFTER the Computer, which the user saw as just above the line.) -->
